#
# File:         sdkconfig.defaults.esp32s3
# Module:       Build / ESP-IDF defaults, ESP32-S3 layer
#
# Purpose:      What every ESP32-S3 build changes from sdkconfig.defaults.
#               ESP-IDF reads this file straight after sdkconfig.defaults
#               for any esp32s3 target, with nothing in platformio.ini to
#               say so (tools/cmake/kconfig.cmake: "<defaults>.<target>"),
#               and a later file wins, so these override the WROOM's.
#
#               Written for the one S3 board this firmware knows, the
#               Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-1.47: an ESP32-S3R8 (8 MB octal PSRAM
#               in the package) beside a 16 MB W25Q128 quad flash, and no
#               USB-serial bridge. Sources for every value are in
#               internal/board-waveshare-s3-lcd147-2026-09-24.md.
#
#               PlatformIO keeps the generated sdkconfig.<env> and a value
#               it already holds wins over this file, and it does not watch
#               this file for changes: delete sdkconfig.ws_s3_lcd147 (and the
#               release one) after editing here, and check the generated file.
#
# Targets:      ESP32-S3 (ESP-IDF 5.3.1)
# See also:     sdkconfig.defaults, platformio.ini, ESP32_BOARD_CHOICE.md
#
